# maximum_exists: I was unsure about "truest". Critics often read "true" in the gradation, P2, as a graded quality of things. In P4 it is the truth that "greatest in truth are greatest in being" makes convertible with being. But S2 and S3 take "true" alongside good and noble as a perfection of beings in both places, so I read it as the same sense.
